(33, 97, NULL, '១០E, ១០F, ១០G', 'Unit1 Aims :  Hold a conversation where people greet  each other ,exchange information about name (with spelling) age, and telephone number', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-28 22:35:09.805189', U&'\1797\17b6\179f\17b6\17a2\1784\17cb\1782\17d2\179b\17c1\179f', 'Unit1 : MY PERSONAL INFORMATION', U&'Unit1 \1782\17c4\179b\1794\17c6\178e\1784\17d6 \1792\17d2\179c\17be\1780\17b6\179a\179f\1793\17d2\1791\1793\17b6\178a\17c2\179b\1798\1793\17bb\179f\17d2\179f\179f\17d2\179c\17b6\1782\1798\1793\17cd\1782\17d2\1793\17b6\1791\17c5\179c\17b7\1789\1791\17c5\1798\1780\1795\17d2\179b\17b6\179f\17cb\1794\17d2\178f\17bc\179a\1796\17d0\178f\17cc\1798\17b6\1793\17a2\17c6\1796\17b8\1788\17d2\1798\17c4\17c7 (\1787\17b6\1798\17bd\1799\1793\17b9\1784\17a2\1780\17d2\1781\179a\17b6\179c\17b7\179a\17bb\1791\17d2\1792) \17a2\17b6\1799\17bb \1793\17b7\1784\179b\17c1\1781\1791\17bc\179a\179f\17d0\1796\17d2\1791'),
(65, 97, NULL, '១០E, ១០F, ១០G', U&'Aims\000d\000aIdentify some countries and tell and ask other people where they are from and their nationalities\000d\000aForms\000d\000aWhere are you from?\000d\000aAre you from China? \000d\000aShe isn''t Cambodian. \000d\000aThey''re from Thailand.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-29 22:14:12.966506', U&'\1797\17b6\179f\17b6\17a2\1784\17cb\1782\17d2\179b\17c1\179f', 'Unit2:  COUNTRIES AND NATIONALITIES', U&'\1782\17c4\179b\1794\17c6\178e\1784\000d\000a\1780\17c6\178e\178f\17cb\17a2\178f\17d2\178f\179f\1789\17d2\1789\17b6\178e\1794\17d2\179a\1791\17c1\179f\1798\17bd\1799\1785\17c6\1793\17bd\1793 \17a0\17be\1799\1794\17d2\179a\17b6\1794\17cb \1793\17b7\1784\179f\17bd\179a\1798\1793\17bb\179f\17d2\179f\1795\17d2\179f\17c1\1784\1791\17c0\178f\1790\17b6\178f\17be\1796\17bd\1780\1782\17c1\1798\1780\1796\17b8\178e\17b6 \1793\17b7\1784\179f\1789\17d2\1787\17b6\178f\17b7\179a\1794\179f\17cb\1796\17bd\1780\1782\17c1\17d4\000d\000a\1791\1798\17d2\179a\1784\17cb\000d\000a\178f\17be\17a2\17d2\1793\1780\1798\1780\1796\17b8\178e\17b6?\000d\000a\178f\17be\17a2\17d2\1793\1780\1798\1780\1796\17b8\1794\17d2\179a\1791\17c1\179f\1785\17b7\1793\1791\17c1? \000d\000a\1793\17b6\1784\1798\17b7\1793\1798\17c2\1793\1787\17b6\1787\1793\1787\17b6\178f\17b7\1781\17d2\1798\17c2\179a\1791\17c1\17d4 \000d\000a\1796\17bd\1780\1782\17c1\1798\1780\1796\17b8\1794\17d2\179a\1791\17c1\179f\1790\17c3\17d4'),
(97, 97, NULL, '១០E, ១០F, ១០G', U&'Aims: Describe the position of things around them and what they look like\000d\000aForms: There is a bag on the TV in the living room. There aren''t any cupboards in the kitchen.\000d\000aVocabulary: sofa, closet, cupboard, desk, mirror, drawers, bookshelf, bed, chair, refrigerator\000d\000a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-30 15:49:35.072277', U&'\1797\17b6\179f\17b6\17a2\1784\17cb\1782\17d2\179b\17c1\179f', 'Unit3: MY HOUSE', U&'\1782\17c4\179b\1794\17c6\178e\1784\17d6 \1796\17b7\1796\178e\17cc\1793\17b6\17a2\17c6\1796\17b8\1791\17b8\178f\17b6\17c6\1784\179a\1794\179f\17cb\179c\178f\17d2\1790\17bb\1787\17bb\17c6\179c\17b7\1789\1781\17d2\179b\17bd\1793 \1793\17b7\1784\179a\17bc\1794\179a\17b6\1784\179a\1794\179f\17cb\179c\17b6\17d4\000d\000a\1791\1798\17d2\179a\1784\17cb\17d6 \1798\17b6\1793\1780\17b6\1794\17bc\1794\178a\17b6\1780\17cb\1791\17bc\179a\1791\179f\17d2\179f\1793\17cd\1780\17d2\1793\17bb\1784\1794\1793\17d2\1791\1794\17cb\1791\1791\17bd\179b\1797\17d2\1789\17c0\179c\17d4 \1798\17b7\1793\1798\17b6\1793\1791\17bc\178a\17b6\1780\17cb\1785\17b6\1793\1793\17c5\1780\17d2\1793\17bb\1784\1795\17d2\1791\17c7\1794\17b6\1799\1791\17c1\17d4\000d\000a\179c\17b6\1780\17d2\1799\179f\1796\17d2\1791\17d6 \179f\17b6\17a1\17bb\1784 \1791\17bc\1781\17c4\17a2\17b6\179c \1791\17bc\178a\17b6\1780\17cb\1785\17b6\1793 \178f\17bb \1780\1789\17d2\1785\1780\17cb \1790\178f\17af\1780\179f\17b6\179a \1792\17d2\1793\17be\179f\17c0\179c\1797\17c5 \1782\17d2\179a\17c2 \1780\17c5\17a2\17b8 \1791\17bc\1791\17b9\1780\1780\1780'),
