(130, '/uploads/audio/1790758175191_68ca2ec6_EG10_UNIT_3.A_2.A__High_quality_.mp3', U&'Kosal: Hi, Tim! Welcome to my house!\000d\000aTim: Hey, Kosal!\000d\000aKosal: Let''s me show you around. This is the kitchen. There are two cupboards.\000d\000aTim: They''re big!\000d\000aKosal: Oh, and there is a refrigerator.\000d\000aTim: Of course. And it''s full of food!\000d\000aKosal: Now this is the living room. There is a sofa for us to sit and watch TV, and there is also a fan. Oh! Look over there, there is a table, and there are four chairs for us to\000d\000ahave our meals.\000d\000aTim: Nice. Is that your bedroom?\000d\000aKosal: Yes, it is. There is a bed, a desk and a chair.\000d\000aTim: Wow! You have five football posters!\000d\000aKosal: Yes, I do. I look like the player right?\000d\000aTim: Is there a mirror in the bathroom?\000d\000aKosal: Yes, there is.\000d\000aTim: Go and have a look', 97, 2, 'Transcript 2:  3A,2A Listening: Tim visits Kosal''s house. Listen and fill in the gaps. Write the answers in your notebook.', U&'\1780\17bb\179f\179b\17d6 \179f\17bd\179f\17d2\178f\17b8 \1792\17b8\1798! \179f\17bc\1798\179f\17d2\179c\17b6\1782\1798\1793\17cd\1798\1780\1780\17b6\1793\17cb\1795\17d2\1791\17c7\179a\1794\179f\17cb\1781\17d2\1789\17bb\17c6!\000d\000a\1792\17b8\1798\17d6 \17a0\17ca\17ba \1780\17bb\179f\179b!\000d\000a\1780\17bb\179f\179b\17d6 \1785\17b6\17c6\1781\17d2\1789\17bb\17c6\1794\1784\17d2\17a0\17b6\1789\17a2\17d2\1793\1780\1787\17bb\17c6\179c\17b7\1789\17d4 \1793\17c1\17c7\1782\17ba\1787\17b6\1795\17d2\1791\17c7\1794\17b6\1799\17d4 \1798\17b6\1793\1791\17bc\178a\17b6\1780\17cb\1785\17b6\1793\1796\17b8\179a\17d4\000d\000a\1792\17b8\1798\17d6 \1782\17c1\1792\17c6\17a0\17be\1799!\000d\000a\1780\17bb\179f\179b\17d6 \17a2\17bc\17ce \17a0\17be\1799\1798\17b6\1793\1791\17bc\179a\1791\17b9\1780\1780\1780\000d\000a\1792\17b8\1798\17d6 \1796\17b7\178f\178e\17b6\179f\17cb\17d4 \17a0\17be\1799\200b\179c\17b6\200b\1796\17c1\1789\200b\178a\17c4\1799\200b\17a2\17