(132, '/uploads/audio/1790759024420_5a7d2e9f_EG10_UNIT_4.A_1.B__High_quality_.mp3', U&'Tim. Oh, I miss home! I miss my aunt, my cousin-1 miss them all!\000d\000aKosal: Well, let''s play football!\000d\000aTim: I''ve got an ideal Here they are! My cousins - I''ve got a photo on my phone!\000d\000aKosal. No-let''s go and play football!\000d\000aTim: Here is my cousin he''s the cutest!\000d\000aHe''s 2! He''s young! He''s got a phone and he takes photos with it. Look! He''s taking photos of my uncle and my aunt.\000d\000aKosal: No way!\000d\000aTim: My uncle''s funny - he''s got blue hair!\000d\000aKosal: Blue hair? (laughs)\000d\000aTim: Yes! And my aunt is over here just beside my cousin She''s really pretty. She''s got long blonde hair and blue eyes. And my grandma is over here - she''s sitting down. I love my grandma! She''s old but she still plays football with me! My grandpa''s tall and fat. Look - he''s as tall as a tree!\000d\000aKosal: My grandpa''s fat too. Look - but he is short. He''s not tall. And here is my mother. She''s got long black hair. My father is next to her. He''s carrying my younger sister. My father is strong! My sister is my favourite person in the world! She''s kind and pretty and young and a.....\000d\000aTim: Can we go and play football now?\000d\000aKosal: Oh, I love my sister. She''s really.....\000d\000aTim: Look my brother is here. Let''s go and play football.\000d\000aKosal: Huh? You haven''t got a brother!', 98, 1, 'Transcript 1: 4A,1B Vocabulary: Listen and check your answers.', U&'\1792\17b8\1798 \17a2\17bc\1781\17d2\1789\17bb\17c6\1793\17b9\1780\1795\17d2\1791\17c7! \1793\17b9\1780\200b\1798\17b8\1784\200b\1794\1784\200b\1794\17d2\17a2\17bc\1793\200b\1787\17b8\178a\17bc\1793\200b\1798\17bd\1799 - \1793\17b9\1780\200b\17a2\17d2\1793\1780\200b\1791\17b6\17c6\1784\200b\17a2\179f\17cb\200b\1782\17d2\1793\17b6!\000d\000a\1780\17bb\179f\179b\17d6 \17a2\1789\17d2\1785\17b9\1784\178f\17c4\17c7\179b\17c1\1784\1794\17b6\179b\17cb\1791\17b6\