(135, '/uploads/audio/1790761164940_0c170128_EG10_UNIT_5.B_1.A__High_quality_.mp3', U&'Staff: Hello, ma''am. How can I help you?\000d\000aWoman: Hello. I need some help! I was washing my hands in the restroom and put my bag on the sink. After I was done, I picked up my shopping bags but left my bag on that sink! I just went back to check but it''s gone.\000d\000aStaff: Okay, ma''am. Which restroom was it? On which floor?\000d\000aWoman: It''s the one the second floor.\000d\000aStaff: We''ve got two restrooms on the second floor. Do you remember which one?\000d\000aWoman: I think that restroom is closer to those exit stairs.\000d\000aStaff: Okay. What time were you in there?\000d\000aWoman: About 2:15-about 30 minutes ago.\000d\000aStaff: Alright. Just a couple more questions. Can you describe what your bag looks like and what you have got in it?\000d\000aWoman: My bag''s blue and it''s got a big white flower print on it. I think I''ve got my glasses, a purse, small notebook, a mobile\000d\000aphone, and my house keys.\000d\000aStaff: Okay. We will contact our security team to check the cameras and get back to you. Is there any number we can contact you by?\000d\000aWoman: Yes, this is my husband''s phone number. Let me write it down for you.\000d\000aStaff: Okay, noted. We will contact our security team to check the cameras and get back to you. Is there any number we can contact you by?\000d\000aWoman: Yes, this is my husband''s phone number. Let me write it down for you.', 99, 2, 'Transcript 2: 5B,1A Listen to her conversation. Write the things the woman has in her bag in your notebook.', U&'\1794\17bb\1782\17d2\1782\179b\17b7\1780\17d6 \1787\17c6\179a\17b6\1794\179f\17bd\179a\179b\17c4\1780\179f\17d2\179a\17b8\17d4 \178f\17be\1781\17d2\1789\17bb\17c6\17a2\17b6\1785\1787\17bd\1799\17a2\17d2\1793\1780\178a\17c4\1799\179a\1794\17c0\1794\178e\17b6?\000d\000a\179f\17d2\178f\17d2\179a\17b8\17d6 \179f\17bd\179f\17d2\178f\17b8\17d4 \1781\17d2\1789\17bb\17c6\178f\17d2\179a